# {project_name} — Example Project Instance

Purpose:
  Example project instance used for demonstration and testing.
  This is NOT a real project — it shows how a project instance
  is structured within SDDRA.

  When a real project is selected by human, a new instance is created
  at .sdd/projects/{project_name}/ following this template.

  This example contains placeholder data for:
    decisions, tasks, docs, stack, testing, context, cases, bugs,
    dependencies, observability, workflow, architecture, and tokens.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @MAP.md
   3 @STRUCTURE.md
   4 @decisions/INDEX.sdd
   5 @tasks/INDEX.sdd
   6 @docs/INDEX.sdd
   7 @stack/INDEX.sdd
   8 @context/INDEX.sdd
   9 @cases/INDEX.sdd
   10 @bugs/INDEX.sdd
   11 @dependencies/INDEX.sdd
   12 @gates/INDEX.sdd
   13 @observability/INDEX.sdd
   14 @workflow/INDEX.sdd
   15 @architecture/INDEX.sdd
   16 @testing/INDEX.sdd
   17 @tokens/

Rules:
  [V1] This is an EXAMPLE project, not a real project.
  [V2] All data in this directory is for demonstration only.
  [V3] When a real project is selected, create .sdd/projects/{project_name}/.
  [V4] Project state MUST live under the real project instance.
  [V5] Decisions MUST be tracked in decisions/.
  [V6] Tasks MUST be tracked in tasks/.
  [V7] Documentation MUST live in docs/.
  [V8] Stack declarations MUST live in stack/.
  [V9] Context MUST be managed in context/.
  [V10] Cases and bugs MUST be tracked in cases/ and bugs/.
  [V11] Dependencies MUST be declared in dependencies/.
  [V12] Gates MUST be enforced via gates/.
  [V13] Observability data MUST live in observability/.
  [V14] Workflow state MUST live in workflow/.
  [V15] Architecture decisions MUST live in architecture/.
  [V16] Test results MUST live in testing/.
  [V17] Token records MUST live in tokens/.
  [V18] MAP.md MUST contain real project location and file mappings.
  [V19] STRUCTURE.md MUST describe the real codebase structure.
  [V20] Feature decisions MUST use MAP.md and STRUCTURE.md for context.

Navigation:
  Model: @../project/INDEX.sdd
  Registry: @../INDEX.sdd
  Map: @MAP.md
  Structure: @STRUCTURE.md
  Decisions: @decisions/INDEX.sdd
  Tasks: @tasks/INDEX.sdd
  Docs: @docs/INDEX.sdd
  Stack: @stack/INDEX.sdd
  Context: @context/INDEX.sdd
  Cases: @cases/INDEX.sdd
  Bugs: @bugs/INDEX.sdd
  Dependencies: @dependencies/INDEX.sdd
  Gates: @gates/INDEX.sdd
  Observability: @observability/INDEX.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow/INDEX.sdd
  Architecture: @architecture/INDEX.sdd
  Testing: @testing/INDEX.sdd
  Tokens: @tokens/
  Features: @../../features/INDEX.sdd

State: ~ (example/template state)
